Z||000010||Spyder||11-30-2000||02:55 AM||||Thermo-Tec Header Wrap, I got it from Summit.  I wrapped them the best that  I could and used metal hose clamps to hold it in place and then cut out the holes where needed.  If anyone needs some wrap, I have an extra box, unopened, that I’ll sell for half of whatever summit has it for, plus shipping.  I was originally going to wrap the whole exhaust, but  I decided I’m too lazy to do it.||||reg||1
