Z||000043||BBBAD GT||12-07-2000||05:21 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Slammed Fiero:<BR><B>What are the specs on the motor??<BR>What does it run in the 1/4<P>I love your trunk and engine compartment ..nice matching of the color<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>The 350 is pretty much a bone stock 86-88 Caprice cop 350 longblock, with a low rise Xcelerator intake and 600 cfm Edelbrock carb.  It dynoed at 207 hp to the rear wheels (untuned), which is about 230-240 flywheel hp.  Haven't had it down the 1/4 yet, but I'd suspect low 14's high 13's, depending on traction.<P>The paint should match, it was painted all at the same time  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>||||reg||1
